---
/**
 * Pull quote, v4 "Delft". MDX: <PullQuote>text</PullQuote>. Bodoni Moda italic 40/50 (28/38 on phones) in Delft Navy,
 * opened by the 40 × 2 saffron rule (the guide's thin accent line; data-gsap="rule" draws it from the left), with
 * generous space above and below so it reads as a break in the column. At ≥ 1200px it reaches 96px into the right
 * column. No left bar, no box.
 */
---
<blockquote class="pull"><span class="pull__rule" aria-hidden="true" data-gsap="rule"></span><p class="pull__text"><slot /></p></blockquote>
<style>
  .pull { margin-block: var(--s-9); padding: 0; }
  .pull__rule { display: block; width: 40px; height: 2px; margin-bottom: var(--s-5); background: var(--saffron); transform-origin: left center; }
  .pull__text {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif); font-style: italic; font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.35rem + 1.6vw, 2.5rem); line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: 0;
    color: var(--head); text-wrap: balance; font-variant-numeric: lining-nums;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1200px) { .pull { margin-right: -96px; } }
</style>
